      "value": "Completed a GED? Order your official GED transcript online to be sent directly to ASU. ASU requires a battery average score of 170 or higher for tests taken after 2013. ASU also accepts the HiSet, TASC (Test Assessing Secondary Completion), California High School Proficiency Examination, and College Credit Pathway, with some limitations.",
